#: ../../../source/controllers/tab5.rst:3
#: ../../../source/refs/controllers.tab5.ref
msgid "Tab5"
msgstr "Tab5"

#: ../../../source/controllers/tab5.rst:7
msgid "Support the following products:"
msgstr "支持以下产品："

#: ../../../source/controllers/tab5.rst:9
msgid "|Tab5|"
msgstr "|Tab5|"

#: ../../../source/controllers/tab5.rst:12
msgid "Supported Components"
msgstr "支持的组件"

#: ../../../source/controllers/tab5.rst:14
msgid "Tab5 includes these user-facing packages:"
msgstr "Tab5 固件包含以下面向用户的软件包："

#: ../../../source/controllers/tab5.rst:16
msgid ""
"`M5UI <../m5ui/index.html>`_: The ``m5ui`` LVGL component library, including"
" ``m5ui.M5Keyboard``."
msgstr "`M5UI <../m5ui/index.html>`_：``m5ui`` LVGL 组件库，包含 ``m5ui.M5Keyboard``。"

#: ../../../source/controllers/tab5.rst:17
msgid ""
"`Module <../module/index.html>`_: The ``module`` package for M-BUS expansion"
" modules."
msgstr "`Module <../module/index.html>`_：用于 M-BUS 扩展模块的 ``module`` 软件包。"

#: ../../../source/controllers/tab5.rst:18
msgid "`Unit <../unit/index.html>`_: The ``unit`` package for Unit drivers."
msgstr "`Unit <../unit/index.html>`_：包含 Unit 驱动的 ``unit`` 软件包。"

#: ../../../source/controllers/tab5.rst:19
msgid ""
"`USB <../advanced/usb/device/index.html>`_: The ``usb.device`` package, "
"including HID, mouse, and keyboard support."
msgstr "`USB <../advanced/usb/device/index.html>`_：``usb.device`` 软件包，支持 HID、鼠标和键盘。"

#: ../../../source/controllers/tab5.rst:20
msgid "`Chain <../chain/index.html>`_: The ``chain`` package for Chain devices."
msgstr "`Chain <../chain/index.html>`_：用于 Chain 设备的 ``chain`` 软件包。"

#: ../../../source/controllers/tab5.rst:21
msgid "`Tab5 <../tab5/index.html>`_: The ``tab5`` package for Tab5 keyboard support."
msgstr "`Tab5 <../tab5/index.html>`_：用于支持 Tab5 键盘的 ``tab5`` 软件包。"

#: ../../../source/controllers/tab5.rst:24
msgid "Supported Display Fonts"
msgstr "支持的显示字体"

#: ../../../source/controllers/tab5.rst:26
msgid ""
"The Tab5 firmware includes the following Montserrat fonts for LVGL and M5UI:"
" ``lv.font_montserrat_12``, ``lv.font_montserrat_14``, "
"``lv.font_montserrat_16``, ``lv.font_montserrat_18``, "
"``lv.font_montserrat_20``, ``lv.font_montserrat_22``, "
"``lv.font_montserrat_24``, ``lv.font_montserrat_30``, "
"``lv.font_montserrat_36``, ``lv.font_montserrat_40``, "
"``lv.font_montserrat_44``, and ``lv.font_montserrat_48``."
msgstr ""
"Tab5 固件为 LVGL 和 M5UI 提供以下 Montserrat "
"字体：``lv.font_montserrat_12``、``lv.font_montserrat_14``、``lv.font_montserrat_16``、``lv.font_montserrat_18``、``lv.font_montserrat_20``、``lv.font_montserrat_22``、``lv.font_montserrat_24``、``lv.font_montserrat_30``、``lv.font_montserrat_36``、``lv.font_montserrat_40``、``lv.font_montserrat_44``"
" 和 ``lv.font_montserrat_48``。"

#: ../../../source/controllers/tab5.rst:33
msgid ""
"For ``M5.Lcd.FONTS``, the firmware also provides ``AlibabaPuHuiTiCN24``, "
"``AlibabaSansJA24``, and ``AlibabaSansKR24`` for Chinese, Japanese, and "
"Korean text respectively."
msgstr ""
"对于 ``M5.Lcd.FONTS``，固件还提供 ``AlibabaPuHuiTiCN24``、``AlibabaSansJA24`` 和 "
"``AlibabaSansKR24``，分别用于显示中文、日文和韩文。"

#: ../../../source/controllers/tab5.rst:38
msgid "Board Features"
msgstr "板载功能"

#: ../../../source/controllers/tab5.rst:40
msgid "Tab5 supports the following built-in functions and board peripherals:"
msgstr "Tab5 支持以下内置功能和板载外设："

#: ../../../source/controllers/tab5.rst:42
msgid ""
"`Display <../hardware/display.html>`_: 5-inch, 1280 x 720 MIPI-DSI "
"touchscreen display."
msgstr "`显示屏 <../hardware/display.html>`_：5 英寸、1280 x 720 分辨率的 MIPI-DSI 触摸显示屏。"

#: ../../../source/controllers/tab5.rst:43
msgid "`Touch <../hardware/touch.html>`_: Capacitive touch input."
msgstr "`触摸 <../hardware/touch.html>`_：电容式触摸输入。"

#: ../../../source/controllers/tab5.rst:44
msgid "`IMU <../hardware/imu.html>`_: BMI270 accelerometer and gyroscope readings."
msgstr "`IMU <../hardware/imu.html>`_：读取 BMI270 加速度计和陀螺仪数据。"

#: ../../../source/controllers/tab5.rst:45
msgid ""
"`Speaker <../hardware/speaker.html>`_ playback and `microphone "
"<../hardware/mic.html>`_ recording."
msgstr "`扬声器 <../hardware/speaker.html>`_ 播放和 `麦克风 <../hardware/mic.html>`_ 录音。"

#: ../../../source/controllers/tab5.rst:46
msgid "RX8130CE real-time clock for date and time keeping."
msgstr "RX8130CE 实时时钟，用于保持日期和时间。"

#: ../../../source/controllers/tab5.rst:47
msgid ""
"`Power <../system/power.html>`_: Battery monitoring, charging, PORT.A "
"output, and USB Type-A output control."
msgstr "`电源 <../system/power.html>`_：电池监测、充电、PORT.A 输出和 USB Type-A 输出控制。"

#: ../../../source/controllers/tab5.rst:48
msgid "microSD card access through ``hardware.SDCard``."
msgstr "通过 ``hardware.SDCard`` 访问 microSD 卡。"

#: ../../../source/controllers/tab5.rst:49
msgid "`PWR485 <../hardware/pwr485.html>`_: RS485 communication."
msgstr "`PWR485 <../hardware/pwr485.html>`_：RS485 通信。"

#: ../../../source/controllers/tab5.rst:50
msgid "Grove and M-BUS expansion interfaces."
msgstr "Grove 和 M-BUS 扩展接口。"
